abstract: |
  datadriftR is an open-source R package that implements a suite of 
  concept drift detection algorithms for univariate data streams, including
  DDM, EDDM, HDDM-A, HDDM-W, KSWIN, Page–Hinkley, and KL divergence–based
  monitoring. Implementations use lightweight R6 classes with constant-time
  updates to support operational monitoring and online learning workflows.

